  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building the Basis for implementing the Save  Grow approach - Regional strategies on sustainable and climate-resilient intensification of cropping systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to more sustainable, productive and climate resilient agricultural practices in Southern Africa and South Asia through equipment, technologies and systems for the major regional staple crops (maize and rice) that are sustainable and resilient under the specific climate change, agro-ecological and socio-economic conditions of the two different regions.</narrative>
  </description>
